ven't reproduced it myself. I'm assuming just running godot on one of these devices would have the error.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nThe error happens very early during startup, so I don't think it is specific to the project.  Games are using compatibility renderer","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116744/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116744/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}